    "# Faster-Whisper ASR Training for Twi/Akan (OPTIMIZED)\n",
    "## High-Performance OpenAI Whisper Fine-tuning with CTranslate2 + Comprehensive Data\n",
    "\n",
    "**Optimized Features:**\n",
    "- ✅ Integrated with comprehensive ASR data inventory from Google Drive\n",
    "- ✅ Production-ready CTranslate2 optimization pipeline\n",
    "- ✅ Multi-dialect support (Asante Twi, Akuapem Twi, Fante, Ga)\n",
    "- ✅ Enhanced language handling for unsupported Twi codes\n",
    "- ✅ 31K+ sample training with proper data splits\n",
    "- ✅ Advanced evaluation and benchmarking framework\n",
    "- ✅ Real-time inference optimization\n",
    "\n",
    "## Model Pipeline:\n",
    "1. **Standard Whisper Training**: Fine-tune on comprehensive Twi dataset\n",
    "2. **CTranslate2 Conversion**: Optimize for production deployment\n",
    "3. **Faster-Whisper Integration**: High-speed inference with maintained accuracy\n",
    "4. **Quantization Options**: INT8, FP16 for different deployment scenarios\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target Performance:** WER <15%, 5-10x speed improvement, Real-time inference"
   ]
  },
